WEBVTT

00:03:58.958 --> 00:04:02.143
(Applause)

00:04:02.167 --> 00:04:05.893
I was used to standing up
on issues like this,

00:04:05.917 --> 00:04:08.542
but why wasn't everyone else?

00:04:09.625 --> 00:04:11.518
My fifth grade teacher,

00:04:11.542 --> 00:04:13.393
Mrs. McFarland,

00:04:13.417 --> 00:04:18.542
taught me that justice
requires an accomplice.

00:04:19.250 --> 00:04:22.309
Not just anyone will do.

00:04:22.333 --> 00:04:26.476
She said we need unlikely allies

00:04:26.500 --> 00:04:29.559
if we want to see real change happen.

00:04:29.583 --> 00:04:34.934
And for those of us
experiencing injustice up front,